\title{mlpp: Machine Learning for Point Processes}
\description{
Provides spatial point process modeling via machine learning methods
(currently supporting gradient boosted decision trees) on planar windows
(\code{ppp}) and linear networks (\code{lpp}), integrating \code{spatstat} quadrature schemes
and interaction diagnostics with Python boosting backends (\code{xgboost}, \code{lightgbm},
\code{catboost}) through \code{reticulate}.
}
